      ],
      "title": "Widespread Belief in Pseudoscience",
      "gist": "Despite living in a scientific age, many people—and even education and criminal-justice policy—embrace ideas like ESP and mysticism that simply don't work.",
      "question": "pseudoscience — why do unproven beliefs persist even in a scientific age? (several examples)"
    },
