      "title": "Naming Cargo Cult Science",
      "gist": "Feynman names 'Cargo Cult Science' for fields that mimic science's form but lack its essential honesty, contrasting it with misleading advertising.",
      "question": "Cargo Cult Science — what is missing from pseudosciences that merely imitate science's form? (one core principle)"
    },
