      "title": "Lessons from Good and Bad Experiments",
      "gist": "Comparing careless psychology and physics studies to one meticulous rat experiment and parapsychology's vanishing effects shows what separates genuine care from cargo cult science.",
      "question": "experiments — what separates careful scientific method from sloppy imitation? (several case studies)"
    },
